ProcessDirect :
---------------
The ProcessDirect adapter in SAP CPI facilitates direct, high-speed communication between integration
flows within the same tenant, reducing latency and network overhead compared to traditional
adapters like HTTP or SOAP. It essentially enables integration flows to call each other directly,
as if they were internal functions, without the need for external communication.
-> With out load balance
->  you cannot use multiple consumers with the same endpoint address in a single ProcessDirect adapter